direction_622 = location "Sheriff" about "Sheriff\nA scolar monster Pathos created by casting a curse on a scarecrow. Levels long-distance curse on all humans who approach. " found "El Morad" at 789 646 in zone 2

On available
    Say "Master, Finding the last Earring of Legend would be a good experience. I reckon Russel would know where to start."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "What? Yeah? You wanted to see me? What about this Earring that holds the strength of Legend?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Hmm. This is no ordinary earring. The earring will only shine with true power for those worthy to wear it. I have it but can't wear it myself. I'll give it to you if you'll hunt the Sheriff. What do you say?"

On in_progress
    Say "Stop wandering around and just go and hunt quickly!"
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_622

On ready
    Say "Well, well. The last Strength of Legends ring is yours now, master. Congratulations!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Hmm... Did you catch them all, already? Well, a promise is a promise, here you go. I hope you are the true owner of this earring."
